    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Class generated from source table 'Album'.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Represents a music album in the digital media store catalogue. Each album has a unique identifier, a title, and is associated with exactly one artist.</rdfs:comment>
